{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/968906-bloodborne-weapon-stats-and-similar","id":968906,"title":"Bloodborne weapon stats (and similar)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-09-13T18:46:29-07:00","id":968906,"title":"Bloodborne weapon stats (and similar)","content":"Just wondering, has anyone tried writing up any of the weapons from Bloodborne (or similar weird gadget weapons) for ChroD? I'm a sucker for weird weapons like gunblade, anchors, rocket hammers, gunlances, etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T06:10:54-07:00","id":969171,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1170_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1170\" data-vbnamecard=\"1170\">amechra</a> wrote something over at <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7015-almarck\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"7015\" data-vbnamecard=\"7015\">Almarck</a>'s mecha thread.<br /> <br /> Otherwise, I don't believe so, though I've been considering writing a few as Fetishes or Talens.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;There is a remedy for everything but death, a hope for everything but wickedness, and everything will lapse except righteousness.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6042-manusdomine","name":"ManusDomine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6042_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T10:26:19-07:00","id":969302,"title":"","content":"For most of those weapons, isn't it just a matter of putting two weapons together or making an ordinary weapon do more damage or have more functions than normal, but at a cost.<br /> <br /> Mind I haven't played Bloodborne, but I've done Warframe.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> For instance:<br /> <br /> Gunblade:<br /> -Treat as pistol for ranged attacks<br /> AND<br /> -Make melee attacks as a sword<br /> <br /> <br /> I'm not doing the Final Fanstasy version since that's exceedingly dumb.<br /> <br /> <br /> Rocket Hammer:<br /> Treat at 6 Damage, AP 3, -8 Initiative","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/607039-homebrew-mechs-walkers-ect\" target=\"_blank\">Mechs:</a> Because even the Chronicles of Darkness needs robot fights.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/813387-darkframe-a-far-future-crossover-setting\" target=\"_blank\">DarkFrame</a>: Crossover setting that puts Chronicles of Darkness in the far future that is Warframe.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/760136-monarch-the-endless\" target=\"_blank\">Monarch: The Endless</a> You are an alien ruler, charged with maintaining a people who you shape to suit your needs.","edited":{"userid":7015,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7015-almarck","user":"Almarck","date":". 09-14-2016, 01:28 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7015-almarck","name":"Almarck","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1156"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T12:49:53-07:00","id":969397,"title":"","content":"I have tried on a few occasions. What I've found is that CofD doesn't have enough dials to turn on weapon stats to meaningfully differentiate <i>all</i> of the Bloodborne weapons. But you could easily make a large number of Bloodborne-style weapons. For example:<br /> <br /> Saw Cleaver (saw)<br /> +1 damage, -3 Initiative, 2 Strength, Size 2, Guard<br /> Saw Cleaver (Cleaver)<br /> +2 damage, -2 Initiative, 2 Strength, Size 2<br /> <br /> Hunter's Axe (one-handed)<br /> +3 damage, -3 Initiative, 3 Strength, Size 3<br /> Hunter's Axe (two-handed)<br /> +3 damage, -4 Initiative, 3 Strength, Size 3, Knockdown, Reach, two-handed<br /> <br /> Threaded Cane (Cane)<br /> +1 damage, -1 Initiative, 2 Strength, Size 2, Stun<br /> Threaded Cane (Whip)<br /> +1 damage, -3 Initiative, 2 Strength, Size 2, Grapple, Inaccurate, Reach","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T12:54:16-07:00","id":969403,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gra